## Durable Decisions
- **Stack:** Next.js 16 App Router + TS + Tailwind v4 + Prisma 6 + Zustand + Lucide React + Zod.
- **Tailwind v4:** tokens defined in `src/app/globals.css` `@theme` block (`background`, `surface`, `border-subtle`, `accent`, `gold`, `text-primary`, `text-secondary`; fonts `display`/`body` via `next/font` variables `--font-jakarta`/`--font-inter`).
- **Next 16 API notes:** `next/image` uses `preload` prop (`priority` deprecated); layouts use typed `LayoutProps<"/">`.
- **Data layer:** `src/lib/tmdb.ts` server-only client — returns mock data (`src/lib/mock-data.ts`, labeled generated defaults) when `TMDB_API_KEY` absent; real TMDB w/ 1h ISR when present.
- **Watchlist state:** Zustand + localStorage persist (`src/store/watchlist.ts`); hydration-safe via `useSyncExternalStore` (React hooks lint forbids setState-in-effect).
- **Scope:** auth/DB routes deferred; Prisma schema (User, WatchlistItem, PlaybackProgress) ready but no DB provisioned yet.
- **Editor quirk:** `write_to_file` intermittently fails when target file is open in a VS Code tab ("User closed text editor"); fallback is shell heredoc (`cat > file << 'EOF'`).

